<view class="container home-page">
  <view class="brandline">
    <view class="brandmark"><view class="brand-seed"></view><view class="brand-leaf"></view></view>
    <view class="brandname">童印 <text>TONGYIN</text></view>
    <view class="brand-side account-entry {{identityState}}" bindtap="accountAction" role="button" aria-label="{{identityLabel}}">
      <view class="account-status-dot"></view>
      <text>{{identityLabel}}</text>
      <view wx:if="{{identityState==='wechat'||identityState==='dev'}}" class="account-entry-chevron">›</view>
      <view wx:elif="{{identityState==='error'}}" class="account-entry-chevron">↻</view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="intro">
    <view class="page-kicker">让每一笔想象，拥有自己的形状</view>
    <view class="hero-title">把孩子的画，<view class="line2">变成<text class="highlight">真正的作品</text><text class="period">.</text></view></view>
    <view class="sub">画下来的小怪兽、幻想朋友和奇妙动物，都能变成立体白模，再亲手涂上专属颜色。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="showcase">
    <view class="showcase-label">FROM PAPER TO REALITY <text>创作示意</text></view>
    <view class="art-stage">
      <view class="picture-paper">
        <view class="paper-topline">① 画在纸上</view>
        <view class="doodle">
          <view class="doodle-ear ear-left"></view><view class="doodle-ear ear-right"></view>
          <view class="doodle-head"><view class="doodle-eye eye-left"></view><view class="doodle-eye eye-right"></view><view class="doodle-smile"></view></view>
          <view class="doodle-feet"></view>
        </view>
        <view class="paper-bottom">一张天马行空的画</view>
      </view>
      <view class="direction"><text>→</text></view>
      <view class="figurine-paper">
        <view class="paper-topline">② 变成立体</view>
        <view class="figure">
          <view class="figure-ear fe-left"></view><view class="figure-ear fe-right"></view>
          <view class="figure-head"><view class="figure-eye fl"></view><view class="figure-eye fr"></view><view class="figure-mouth"></view></view>
          <view class="figure-body"></view><view class="figure-base"></view>
        </view>
        <view class="paper-bottom">一个能捧在手里的作品</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="visual-footer"><view class="visual-dot"></view><text>白色 PLA 打印 · 可以自己上色</text></view>
  </view>
  <button class="btn start-button" bindtap="toCreate"><text class="btn-label">开始制作我的童印</text><text class="btn-arrow">↗</text></button>
  <view class="button-caption">从一张画开始，作品进度可以随时回来查看</view>
  <view wx:if="{{recent}}" class="latest" bindtap="openRecent">
    <view class="latest-photo"><image src="{{recent.cover}}" mode="aspectFill"/></view>
    <view class="latest-info"><view class="latest-kicker">接着上次的创作</view><view class="latest-name">{{recent.label}}</view><view class="latest-link">继续查看 <text>→</text></view></view>
    <view class="latest-count">{{count}} 幅作品</view>
  </view>
  <view class="how-header"><view class="section-title">三步，把想象带回家</view><view class="tiny-english">HOW IT WORKS</view></view>
  <view class="steps">
    <view class="step"><view class="step-number">01</view><view class="step-content"><view class="step-name">上传一张画</view><view class="step-desc">保留孩子笔下与众不同的模样</view></view><view class="step-accent">✳</view></view>
    <view class="step"><view class="step-number">02</view><view class="step-content"><view class="step-name">挑选喜欢的形象</view><view class="step-desc">确认喜欢的形象</view></view><view class="step-accent">↗</view></view>
    <view class="step"><view class="step-number">03</view><view class="step-content"><view class="step-name">定制专属白模</view><view class="step-desc">收到实物后，继续自己涂色创作</view></view><view class="step-accent">✦</view></view>
  </view>
  <view class="footnote">由家长操作和下单，生成造型与最终实物可能有细节差异。</view>
</view>